            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for constructive suggestion! (And special thanks for opening an issue first and not PR straight away)\r\n\r\nAround couple of weeks ago I'd reject right away, but since then I decided to add **selective** tree-sitter support. I'll take a look at what base color might suit best (`base0C` looks like a good option as it is used for `Special` which is described as \"any special symbol\"; or `base09` as it is used for `Constant`; or indeed `base0E` as in `Keyword`) and add it myself.",
